---
title: Web components that render on the server
summary: A web component can paint before its JavaScript loads if the server renders it. Put its server output inside `{@html}` in a host that stays Svelte markup, and the island around it still hydrates. This page shows the pattern, when it works, and when to use `rewrite()` instead.
related:
  - regions/dom-ownership
